sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client / Admin UI
    participant MedusaAPI as Medusa API (Express)
    participant FileMod as File Module
    participant LocalSvc as LocalFileService
    participant FS as Local Filesystem
    participant StaticMW as Express Static Middleware

    Note over Client,StaticMW: Upload flow
    Client->>MedusaAPI: POST /admin/uploads\n(multipart/form-data)
    MedusaAPI->>FileMod: upload(fileDTO)
    FileMod->>LocalSvc: upload({ filename, content, access, ... })
    LocalSvc->>LocalSvc: parse filename → dir, name, ext
    LocalSvc->>LocalSvc: fileKey = [private-]Date.now()-filename.ext
    LocalSvc->>LocalSvc: baseDir = access==="public" ? uploadDir : privateUploadDir
    LocalSvc->>FS: ensureDirExists(baseDir, subDir)\n→ fs.mkdir({ recursive: true })
    FS-->>LocalSvc: directory ready
    LocalSvc->>LocalSvc: decode content\n(base64 → buffer | utf8 | binary)
    LocalSvc->>FS: fs.writeFile(filePath, content)
    FS-->>LocalSvc: written
    LocalSvc-->>FileMod: { key: fileKey, url: backendUrl/fileKey }
    FileMod-->>MedusaAPI: { file }
    MedusaAPI-->>Client: { file: { url, key } }

    Note over Client,StaticMW: Serving file (static middleware)
    Client->>MedusaAPI: GET /static/<fileKey>
    MedusaAPI->>StaticMW: serve /static/<fileKey>
    StaticMW->>FS: read <uploadDir>/<fileKey>
    FS-->>StaticMW: file bytes
    StaticMW-->>Client: file content (200 OK)

    Note over Client,StaticMW: Download URL (no real presigning)
    Client->>MedusaAPI: GET /admin/uploads/:key/url
    MedusaAPI->>FileMod: getPresignedDownloadUrl({ fileKey })
    FileMod->>LocalSvc: getPresignedDownloadUrl({ fileKey })
    LocalSvc->>FS: fs.access(filePath, F_OK)
    alt file exists
        FS-->>LocalSvc: ok
        LocalSvc-->>FileMod: "<backendUrl>/<fileKey>" (direct URL)
        FileMod-->>MedusaAPI: url
        MedusaAPI-->>Client: { url }
    else file missing
        FS-->>LocalSvc: ENOENT
        LocalSvc-->>FileMod: MedusaError(NOT_FOUND)
        FileMod-->>MedusaAPI: 404
        MedusaAPI-->>Client: error
    end

    Note over Client,StaticMW: Delete flow
    Client->>MedusaAPI: DELETE /admin/uploads/:key
    MedusaAPI->>FileMod: delete({ fileKey })
    FileMod->>LocalSvc: delete({ fileKey })
    LocalSvc->>LocalSvc: startsWith("private-") → pick baseDir
    LocalSvc->>FS: fs.access(filePath, W_OK)
    LocalSvc->>FS: fs.unlink(filePath)
    alt file exists
        FS-->>LocalSvc: deleted
    else ENOENT
        FS-->>LocalSvc: ENOENT (ignored)
    end
    LocalSvc-->>FileMod: void
    FileMod-->>MedusaAPI: void
    MedusaAPI-->>Client: 200 OK
